title: "Legacy Technology Observatory"
abstract: "An evidence portal on the old technology behind UK public services, from programming languages and mainframes to networks, devices, operational technology and encryption: where it runs, what it costs, who can maintain them, how they drive technical debt, how the public sector is moving off them, and the equality and skills implications."
